    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "Make sure to use a **dashed, straight line** when drawing your intermolecular forces! Hydrogen bonds should **start at the lone pair** and go **right up to the delta positive atom** - it must be really clear where your H bond starts and ends.",
